    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "AI Research Chat",
    "long_instructions": "##AI Research Chat\r\n\r\n_How to use this tool:_\r\n* **Ask \"Why\" and \"How\"**: If a concept in your mini-lesson is confusing, ask the AI to explain it simply or provide an example.\r\n* **Explore Tradeoffs**: Ask the AI to help you weigh the pros and cons of your specific topic to see all sides of the issue.\r\n* **Test Your Ideas**: Share your initial thoughts and ask the AI for feedback or different perspectives.\r\n* **Make the Final Call**: Use the AI as a thinking partner to gather information, but remember that you make the final decision.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use this AI Research Chat to further explore any of the ideas that you encountered in your mini-lesson.",
